caphv-generate: cluster manifest generator of the Cluster API Provider Harvester
(CAPHV), copied unchanged so that the console can render clusters offline.

Source:   https://github.com/harvester/cluster-api-provider-harvester
          (development fork: gitea jniedergang/cluster-api-provider-harvester)
File:     bin/caphv-generate
Commit:   5373a21672008ad15240d3e3bfb6660d9331e935 (2026-09-01, after tag v0.10.1)
License:  Apache-2.0 (same as harvester-ops)

The console corrects its output instead of editing the script (see
bin/lib/capi_cluster.py, postprocess): Harvester objects are moved from
infrastructure v1alpha1 to v1beta1, the Rancher auto-import label is removed
unless asked for, and the targetNamespace variable is set.

To update: copy the script from a newer CAPHV commit, update this file, and
run tests/api/test_capi_generator.py, which renders real manifests with it.
